  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Renovation of the University Library in Pristina to create a digital classroom. Interactive democracy education will be conducted as well as computer literacy education in order to bridge the enormous gap to the rest of the world. Special efforts will be made to target women and youth.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Upprustning av Universitetsbiblioteket i Pristina till ett digitalt klassrum. Interaktiva utbildningar i demokrati skall genomf&#xf6;ras d&#xe4;r liksom utbildningar i datakunskap, detta f&#xf6;r att t&#xe4;cka det stora gapet till resten av v&#xe4;rlden. Speciella insatser skall g&#xf6;ras f&#xf6;ra tt rekrytera kvinnor och ungdomar.</narrative>
